@startuml
title Home Page (Feed) Activity Diagram
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor black
skinparam swimlaneTitleBackgroundColor #EEE
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam activityArrowColor #333
skinparam activityBorderColor #333
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 50

|User|
|System| (Web App & Database)

|User|
start
:Access Home Page;
|System|
:Fetch Shares (Paginated);
:Select Shares with Relations;
:Return View with Shares;

|User|
split
    :Click **Comment**;
    |System|
    :Show Comment Input;
    |User|
    :Submit Comment;
    |System|
    :Store Comment;
    :Update View;
split again
    :Click **Like / Dislike**;
    |System|
    :Toggle Status;
    :Update Counts & Icon;
split again
    :Click **Save (Bookmark)**;
    |System|
    :Toggle Bookmark Status;
    :Update Icon (Yellow);
split again
    :Click Song Link (Spotify/YouTube);
    |System|
    :Redirect to External URL;
end split

stop
@enduml
